      "writtenOn": "2024-04-09T22:21:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We want some module to be able to write an owner/team that is distinct from the package.  I find this unlikely and think people could always create a subdir to hold the test with a different owner with needed, but this is what we came to consensus on.\n\nThis is related to the \"test_module_config\" work and splitting up FrameworksServicesTests into several different modules.  The belief is the modules will be owned by different teams, but might be listed in the same .bp file.\n\nRunning the \"all_teams\" rule on aosp takes 400 millis",
      "parentUuid": "19b5c489_075ef96f",
      "revId": "2387774a36bd210b6f78d38329485e0bc7980a21",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
