      "writtenOn": "2024-04-09T23:07:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But isn\u0027t `lookupDefaultTeam(...)` only called when `teamName` is not specified in the module, based on the current implementation:\n```\nif teamName !\u003d \"\" {\n\tteamProperties, found \u003d t.teams[teamName]\n} else {\n\tteamProperties, found \u003d t.lookupDefaultTeam(m.bpFile)\n}\n```\n?\nWouldn\u0027t pre-processing default team per bp file directory (which can be overridden by `teamName` property later) possible?",
